	(text "J1201 is a 2x5 header: pins 1 to 8 are D0 to D7, pins 9 and 10 ground.\nU1203 port B is powered from VOUT_BUF, so the inputs follow DUT logic levels from 1.65 V to 5.5 V.\nDIR and OE are referenced to port A (+3V3_C): DIR low sets the direction B to A.\nWith VOUT_BUF off the outputs float; the logic device holds DIN0 to DIN7 with its pull-ups.\nEach input loads the DUT pin with 1 M to ground."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
